function.description:
Retrieve information for a client given their client_id.

Args:
    client_id (str): The unique identifier of the client.

Returns:
    dict: {
        "success": True,
        "data": ClientInfo,  # If client found
    }
    or
    {
        "success": False,
        "error": str  # If client does not exist
    }

